- `crates/viola-agent-claude/src/screen.rs` (`:10-95`) — `SIGNATURES.modals` = `["Yes, I trust this folder",
  "Yes, allow external imports"]` (trust first, imports second), `holds_modal`, `holds_footer`, `input_box_up`;
  `Screen::rows` is `None` when poisoned.

5. **Extra flags** — Run C adds `--settings <dialog settings>`, Run D `--permission-mode plan --settings <plans>`;
   Run B, E and F add none beyond the plugin dir. `--model haiku` is on both sides (verify `typed.rs:78`, the rig's
   wrapped arms `viola-live-rig.rs:198`): excluded.

- (tests) The V rehearsal reads `git-root: written`, `screen-a: trust`, `screen-b` … `screen-f: box`, six `settle-*`
  numbers and `failing: none` over the fake agent (`rig_rehearsal_v_reads_the_trust_record_row_and_no_record_left`);
  the rig ledger admits `S0R-3` as a spare (`admit_counts_a_dash_three_label_as_a_spare`).

- (tests, Revision 1) The V arm's private config holds, after the seed, exactly the seed's two keys plus the six
  bundle markers at the Revision 1 table's values (`seed_used_markers_writes_the_six_bundle_markers_and_keeps_the_seed`);
  every other arm's seed is unchanged; the V rehearsal reads `seed-markers: written`.

